! DEMONSTRATION ONLY: uncalibrated one-step replacement, NOT LLNL kinetics.
! A=1e12 cm3/mol/s, beta=0, Ea=30000 cal/mol; first order each in fuel and O2.
! Suitable for input/workflow testing, not predictive combustion results.
ELEMENTS
C H O N
END
SPECIES
NC12H26 O2 N2 CO2 H2O
END
REACTIONS CAL/MOLE MOLES
NC12H26 + 18.5 O2 => 12 CO2 + 13 H2O   1.000E12 0.0 30000.0
FORD / NC12H26 1.0 /
FORD / O2 1.0 /
END
